From: audit studio (2026-11-10), finding STUDIO-02
Subject: catalogue boards follow the cross-check like the game and the explainer

server/stagecraft/catalogue.js withholds the game and the explainer of a topic whose blind cross-check failed or never
ran ("reported, never shown"), but still listed its whiteboard boards, which board-first.js:217 and board-sync.js:470
serve. In the shipped catalogue that is 13 topics and 102 boards (7 failed, 6 never checked). After this, those topics fall back to
the code boards like any topic without a catalogue entry. Test: tests/r7-audit-studio-catalogue-boards.test.mjs fails
2/3 before, passes 3/3 after; 170 existing tests that read the catalogue pass. Apply with `git apply`.

